    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d458">

                <pb facs="0440" n="358" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg358"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 311.122 R61/6.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Mexican Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexican Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-11-13"><hi rendition="#italic">November 13,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have already had the honor to
                        acknowledge<anchor n="1" xml:id="d458-f1"/> your excellency’s note of the
                    11th [etc.]. I now have the honor to present through your excellency the thanks
                    of President Díaz to President Taft for his promise thoroughly to investigate
                    the incident of the burning at the stake of the Mexican Antonio Rodríguez, in
                    Texas.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.],</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. L. De la
                    Barra.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
